# Runtime x database matrix on Drupal 12 (PHP 8.5): nginx, the source-built
# nginx baseline, Angie and FreeNginx each against FreeUnit, plus the two
# fork-vs-baseline checks, then the same servers over mysqli, PostgreSQL and
# SQLite.  Each site key is <site>-<db>, so the backends do not share state.
